/figcaption></figure><p>營收飆379%分紅卻縮水！美光員工氣炸99%同意罷工</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T04:19:31.279999+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1625,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T04:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:17:47.630449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T04:17:39.763154+00:00","content_hash":"c7a5c51b7bddc09179ad40cdcd9250850c7ca4b81bd7efaa2a7c146eb0631f1f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}